#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:5
msgid "Title block extra information"
msgstr "图框额外信息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to define a string field property named "
"**Extra information**. This property field is provided to allow the user "
"defining the author and/or license from `title block`_. Any other "
"information can also be defined in this property field."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了定义一个名为 **的字符串字段属性的选项。 extra information**。 此属性字段允许用户从 `图框 "
"<title block_>`_ 定义作者和/或许可证。 任何其他信息也可以在此属性字段中定义 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block extra information PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框额外信息 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:16
msgid "To display/edit the extra information from the `title block`_:"
msgstr "要显示/编辑来自 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的额外信息："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:18
msgid "`Display title block`_ in the `title block editor`_."
msgstr "`显示图框 <Display title block_>`_ 输入 `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:19
msgid ""
"Go to **Edit > Edit extra information** menu item to display extra "
"information PopUP window."
msgstr "转到 **Edit > 编辑额外信息** 菜单项以显示额外信息 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/extra_info.rst:28
msgid ""
"For more information about customizing title block extra information, refer "
"to `define title block extra information`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于自定义图框额外信息的更多信息，请参见 `定义图框额外信息 <define title block extra information_>`_ 节。"
